# Gate 12: Status & Reporting

**Status**: pending
**Type**: feature
**Created**: 2026-02-04
**Sequence**: 12 of 14
**Hash**: #g12status

<!-- Status lifecycle:
  - pending: Gate generated at init, requirements not yet decomposed
